        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870130/extras/bf67caed3f3d7d3097efefa0005e59ec.avif?t=1772450600\" width=300 height=350 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870130/extras/69d2f365436da70012618c7e0148eaa8.avif?t=1772450600\" width=300 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master any element of your choice and bring down the gods who stand against you. GODS AND MAGES is a survival roguelite where you rescue a princess from the grips of evil gods in return for the king's reward. Unlock, craft and master over 5000 spells from over 8 different elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870130/extras/e558548c78ecd9c9c57b40310f35f46c.avif?t=1772450600\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a mage that uses any element you prefer and enter the forest of death to complete your mission. Take control of over 5000 spells varying from the elements of fire, water, lightening, animal, orbal, necromancer, chaos and weapons to destroy your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you obliterate monsters and gods, recover gold stolen from the king and choose from a massive selection of upgrades, spells and summons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the perfect strategy for your character and become an unstoppable force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870130/extras/7393c20b488dcd66252eadd6888d4131.avif?t=1772450600\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different elemental mages to suit your taste</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of spells to create your own tactics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the skill tree to unveil every more powerful spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A well crafted story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every completed run, the game unlocks an new difficulty making the gameplay replayable</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870130/extras/bf67caed3f3d7d3097efefa0005e59ec.avif?t=1772450600\" width=300 height=350 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870130/extras/69d2f365436da70012618c7e0148eaa8.avif?t=1772450600\" width=300 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master any element of your choice and bring down the gods who stand against you. GODS AND MAGES is a survival roguelite where you rescue a princess from the grips of evil gods in return for the king's reward. Unlock, craft and master over 5000 spells from over 8 different elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870130/extras/e558548c78ecd9c9c57b40310f35f46c.avif?t=1772450600\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a mage that uses any element you prefer and enter the forest of death to complete your mission. Take control of over 5000 spells varying from the elements of fire, water, lightening, animal, orbal, necromancer, chaos and weapons to destroy your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you obliterate monsters and gods, recover gold stolen from the king and choose from a massive selection of upgrades, spells and summons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the perfect strategy for your character and become an unstoppable force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870130/extras/7393c20b488dcd66252eadd6888d4131.avif?t=1772450600\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different elemental mages to suit your taste</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of spells to create your own tactics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the skill tree to unveil every more powerful spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A well crafted story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every completed run, the game unlocks an new difficulty making the gameplay replayable</p></li></ul>",
